<section id="data" aria-labelledby="h-board">
  <h2 id="h-board" class="sec">Leaderboard</h2>
  <p class="sub">Every run we have logged, next to the published models. Click a column heading to sort.</p>
  <div class="scroll" id="board-scroll"><table id="board"><tbody><tr class="skrow"><td><div class="sk"></div></td></tr><tr class="skrow"><td><div class="sk"></div></td></tr><tr class="skrow"><td><div class="sk"></div></td></tr><tr class="skrow"><td><div class="sk"></div></td></tr><tr class="skrow"><td><div class="sk"></div></td></tr><tr class="skrow"><td><div class="sk"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
  <div class="tools">
    <details class="tool" id="filters-wrap"><summary>Filter runs</summary>
      <div class="filters" id="filters">
        <label>Model <select id="f-runner"></select></label>
        <label>Task set <select id="f-split"></select></label>
        <label>Moves from <select id="f-action"></select></label>
        <label>Branch <select id="f-branch"></select></label>
        <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="f-tests"> Show pipeline tests <span id="hidden-count" class="std"></span></label>
        <label class="check" title="Runs that failed, were cancelled, or still say running long after the job limit. None produced a score."><input type="checkbox" id="f-ended"> Show runs with no result <span id="ended-count" class="std"></span></label>
      </div>
    </details>
    <details class="tool" id="compare"><summary>Compare two runs</summary>
      <p class="callout" style="margin-top:0">Pick a run or published model to compare against. A difference counts only if it is bigger than twice the usual disagreement between two scorings of the same videos; smaller ones are marked "too small to count".</p>
      <div class="filters"><label>Compare against <select id="cmp-base"></select></label></div>
      <div class="scroll"><table id="cmp"></table></div>
      <p class="callout" id="cmp-note"></p>
    </details>
    <details class="tool"><summary>How to read this table</summary>
      <ul class="plain">
        <li>Empty cells mean not measured, not zero.</li>
        <li>The best score in each column is underlined; tiny test runs and capped smoke runs are never underlined. Only runs that meet every final-score check compare fairly with the published scores.</li>
        <li>"Checks" shows which of the five final-score checks a run meets; "Scored" is how many times the judge scored it.</li>
        <li>Runs that failed or were cancelled, and status rows still marked running hours after the job limit, are hidden by default; none produced a score. "Show runs with no result" lists them.</li>
        <li>"capped smoke" rows stop each rollout after 10 of 30 chunks. They check behaviour only and never set the headline, the ruler, the task-type scores or the best-so-far line.</li>
        <li>The filters also change the charts under Progress.</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="cklegend" id="cklegend"></div>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>
